    @template core_admin/oauth2/server/client_secret_expiry_notification
    @summary Renders a notification about expiring client secrets.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * warningtext - The pre-localized lead warning sentence.
    * actiontext - The pre-localized call to action sentence containing the manage link.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "warningtext": "The OAuth 2 client \"Example Client\" has 1 secret expiring in 7 days.",
        "actiontext": "To avoid service disruptions for this client, please visit the <a href='https://example.com'>Manage secrets</a> page to rotate the affected secrets before they expire."
    }
}}
<p>{{warningtext}}</p>
<p>{{{actiontext}}}</p>
